.SP p2
.L 47.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]Natsuki fought her way up the corporate ladder at
.L 57.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]Malicron only to find herself treated as a trophy
.L 67.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]rather than a talent. Once she finally seized control
.L 77.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]of the company, she purged its male staff entirely
.L 87.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]and built a gauntlet capable of enforcing her will by
.L 97.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]force, determined that no man would ever hold
.L 107.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]power over her again.
.L 367.69 217.40
\f[NSR]\s[8]Commanding, intimidating, and openly
.L 377.69 217.40
\f[NSR]\s[8]contemptuous of men, Natsuki carries
.L 387.69 217.40
\f[NSR]\s[8]herself with an air of intense, calculated
.L 397.69 217.40
\f[NSR]\s[8]authority.
.CP
.SH
\&Natsuki: Attacks
.PP
\&Gauntlet Bull: A fierce punch with speed and power can bowl over even stalwart foes.
.PP
\&Gauntlet Bear: Natsuki grasps her opponent in her clutches and doesn't let go.
.PP
\&Gauntlet Crash: Natsuki pounds the ground, sending out a shockwave of destruction all around her.
.PP
\&Stiletto Kick: Even without her signature gauntlet, Natsuki proves a formidable fighter.
.SH
\&Natsuki: Malicron Corporation
.PP
\&As head of a military-technology powerhouse, Natsuki can call on a wide range of vehicles, equipment, and arms, and can summon trained security officers (armed guards with a modest Ranged Attack bonus) to her side at will.
.SH
\&Natsuki: A Secret Garden
.PP
\&Atop Malicron's headquarters, Natsuki keeps a hidden flower garden — a private sanctuary where she can set aside her public persona, known to almost no one.
